  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-25T03:20:27.086Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This happened in build 1878 too.\n\nI am a ID Verified minor, and when I logged in a checked to see if I can show anything related to ID verified.. I found a option to and clicked on it, it said failed to save profile but I just left and saw I had a 18+ Verified badge.\n\nAdding on: This does NOT let you join 18+ verified instances.. its only a visual bug.\n\nHow to reproduce the issue:\n\n1: Be a ID Verified minor (under 18)\n\n2: Go to your profile\n\n3: Edit Profile\n\n4: Toggle \"Display age verification\"\n\n5: Save and close, it will say failed to save, just click leave without saving.\n\n6: Boom.. 18+ now.",
